  - title: The Gear
    description: One-time buys that make everything else pay more. Cutting a demo
      clears them, and you buy them back faster each run.
    visibleWhen:
      rid: 7579425512644149323
    scope: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7730b93caaf305b48bad38f664d1aca2, type: 2}
