  - title: The Rehearsal Space
    description: Rehearsal builds up while you play. Spend it learning covers, one
      at a time, and each one you learn draws a bigger crowd.
    visibleWhen:
      rid: 7579425512644149329
    scope: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7730b93caaf305b48bad38f664d1aca2, type: 2}
    modules:
    - prefabId: bar_group
      content: {fileID: 0}
      visibleWhen:
        rid: -2
      scope: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7730b93caaf305b48bad38f664d1aca2, type: 2}
  - title: The Release
    description: Cut a demo when you have 50 fans and a cover. It banks Records and
      Demo Tapes and resets the run.
    visibleWhen:
      rid: 7579425512644149330
    scope: {fileID: 11400000}
    modules:
    - prefabId: rung_button
      content: {fileID: 0}
      visibleWhen:
        rid: -2
      scope: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7730b93caaf305b48bad38f664d1aca2, type: 2}
  - title: Garage Jam
    description: Three timed sprints, one at a time. The band goes quiet and you
      tap alone for the goal, and clearing one pays more cash per tap for the rest
      of the chapter.
    visibleWhen:
      rid: 7579425512644149331
    scope: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7730b93caaf305b48bad38f664d1aca2, type: 2}
